    "body": "Run 44279917425 (main 110aca435, batch tier): FAIL, 3 suites, wall 49.6 min.\nReport job skipped (#1611), so this is filed by hand.\n\n1. `microarc_test_part` - `a_wrapped_op_on_the_test_part_posts_wrapped_a`. Already listed above.\n2. `ui lib` - `guide_projects::demo_projects_build_and_load_with_valid_paths`. Already listed above.\n3. `stock_source_holes` - `framed_stock_chamfer_live_refusal_keeps_hint_without_local_move_number`. New in this list. `main` already carries the fixes `aac2dbf26` and `0d58ccca8` for that hint path, and they are after 110aca435. The next batch run on the current head (44285991575 or 44291554483) decides whether failure 3 is gone.\n\nA green run closes this issue.\n",
